[2026-06-01 12:50] SeriesForm soft-warning GREEN. Tallis's RED is at `b6b1173` (1 RED + the `seasons_warning_outside_season` key from Comenius at `9ef11c3`).

**Sync:** `git fetch origin && git reset --hard origin/fix/conductor-dedupe` → tip `b6b1173`. Own worktree; push.

**GREEN — `SeriesForm.svelte`** (per Tallis's notes): show a NON-blocking warning when series dates fall outside the season, and DON'T block submit:
```svelte
let outsideSeason = $derived(
  (startDate && startDate < season.startDate) ||
  (endDate && endDate > season.endDate)
);
```
```svelte
{#if outsideSeason}
  <div data-testid="series-season-warning" class="warning">{m.seasons_warning_outside_season()}</div>
{/if}
```
Submit still fires `oncreate` regardless (validateSeries no longer fails on outside-season — Josquin's change). In-range dates → no warning.

`pnpm test src/lib/components/seasons/SeriesForm.spec.ts` → GREEN + full suite green + `pnpm check` 0. Commit `fix(seasons): SeriesForm soft warning for outside-season dates`, push, handoff with tip SHA + raw gate tail → that closes the batch; I route Bentham for the whole-branch review. Tallis's notes are source of truth.
